  "title": "Italian White Bean and Pancetta Soup",
  "description": "Canned cannellini beans, Italian bacon, and pasta make up this satisfying soup flavored with fresh sage. Garnish with freshly grated Romano or Parmigiano cheese.",
  "authors": [
